/* ---- THE AUCTION ----------------------------------------------------------
   [prompt, the host's ruling note]
   No theme, no difficulty, no pairing ticker — an auction category is not
   easy or hard, it is just wide or narrow, and the bidding is what sets the
   difficulty. The note exists because every one of these gets argued: it says
   what counts, so the host rules once and the table moves on.
   The theme is the literal string 'Auction' and is deliberately NOT in THEMES
   — it must never appear in the party game's theme picker or in solo. Filter
   the bank by Type instead.
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
